This project is an independent, from-scratch reimplementation inspired by
Claude-Mem (https://github.com/thedotmack/claude-mem), Copyright 2026 Alex
Newman, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The architecture
(lifecycle hooks -> observer compression -> SQLite/FTS search -> context
injection, and the search/timeline/get_observations progressive-disclosure
pattern) follows ideas from that project. No source code from Claude-Mem's
commercial or PolyForm-licensed components is included.

The knowledge-graph memory layer borrows ideas (confidence tags, entity
de-duplication guards, key nodes, communities, path/explain, lessons from
past answers) from Graphify (https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify),
Copyright 2026 Safi Shamsi and the Graphify contributors, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. It is written from scratch; no Graphify code is
included.

